        ":question/math-academy-id": "q-27015",
        ":question/problem": "Which of the following statements are true regarding the function $y = \\cos x$? Assume that $n$ is an integer.\n\nSelect all that apply.\n\n- **I.** The function has maximum values at $x = \\frac{π}{2} + nπ$.\n- **II.** The function is zero at $x = \\frac{3π}{2}$.\n- **III.** The range of the function is $[- π, π]$.",
        ":question/worked-solution": "Cosine attains its maxima at x=2n*pi, vanishes at x=3pi/2, and has range [-1,1]. Only statement II is true."
      },
